Grammar

Rule 0     S' -> document
Rule 1     document -> elements
Rule 2     elements -> elements element
Rule 3     elements -> element
Rule 4     element -> TAG_OPEN
Rule 5     element -> TAG_CLOSE
Rule 6     element -> TAG_SLASH_CLOSE
Rule 7     element -> HREF
Rule 8     element -> SRC

Terminals, with rules where they appear

HREF                 : 7
SRC                  : 8
TAG_CLOSE            : 5
TAG_OPEN             : 4
TAG_SLASH_CLOSE      : 6
error                : 

Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

document             : 0
element              : 2 3
elements             : 1 2

Parsing method: LALR

state 0

    (0) S' -> . document
    (1) document -> . elements
    (2) elements -> . elements element
    (3) elements -> . element
    (4) element -> . TAG_OPEN
    (5) element -> . TAG_CLOSE
    (6) element -> . TAG_SLASH_CLOSE
    (7) element -> . HREF
    (8) element -> . SRC

    TAG_OPEN        shift and go to state 4
    TAG_CLOSE       shift and go to state 5
    TAG_SLASH_CLOSE shift and go to state 6
    HREF            shift and go to state 7
    SRC             shift and go to state 8

    document                       shift and go to state 1
    elements                       shift and go to state 2
    element                        shift and go to state 3

state 1

    (0) S' -> document .



state 2

